<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <Description>Data types and interfaces for the Munin Explorer API — the shapes returned by the API, IMuninExplorerClient, and IMuninExplorerTokenProvider. No dependencies at all, so a host can implement or substitute either interface without taking on the HTTP client or the Blazor component. Both of those packages depend on this one; you rarely install it directly.</Description>
